# Custom in-house text library

## Context

`app/src/lib/text.ts` is a small in-house helper library. Its API is fixed
for the purposes of the exercise and should be trusted when writing rules.

## Rule

- The library exposes exactly: `slugify`, `truncate`, `normalizeSpaces` with
  the signatures in `app/src/lib/text.ts`.
- Do not assume or call helpers that do not exist (e.g., `capitalize`,
  `camelCase`). If a helper is needed, add it explicitly to this library and
  include a test.

## How to verify

1. Open `app/src/lib/text.ts` and confirm the three exported functions.
2. Grep assistant suggestions for calls to nonexistent helpers and flag them.